<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8772] WebSessionFilter does not work with jetty 9.4 anymore</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8772</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Jetty adds a workername suffix to the session cookie, using . as delimeter:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;SESSIONID.node0&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In doFilterV2 the requested sessionid is read from cookie, which contains the suffix:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;private&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; doFilterV2(HttpServletRequest httpReq, ServletResponse res, FilterChain chain)
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;throws&lt;/span&gt; IOException, ServletException, CacheException {
WebSessionV2 cached = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; sesId = httpReq.getRequestedSessionId();
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This id will never be found in the cache, because the cache key for new sessions is just the part before the dot.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is/may be fixed, by adding another session id transformer in the init method. For example:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (srvInfo != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt; &amp;amp;&amp;amp; srvInfo.contains(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;jetty&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)) {
  sesIdTransformer = s -&amp;gt; {
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; idx = s.indexOf(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;.&apos;&lt;/span&gt;);

    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (idx &amp;lt; 0 || idx == s.length() - 1) {
      &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; s;
    }

   2 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; s.substring(0, idx);
  };
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;jetty-distribution-9.4.10.v20180503&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;ignite 2.5.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</environment>
